WEBVTT

00:04:00.465 --> 00:04:02.135
In many a long walk,

00:04:02.962 --> 00:04:09.123
I wondered how we could
get it right again as a nation.

00:04:09.756 --> 00:04:11.649
More than 20 years later,

00:04:11.673 --> 00:04:14.335
in April 2018,

00:04:14.359 --> 00:04:18.591
with a few more wrinkles and grey hair,

00:04:18.615 --> 00:04:20.472
I was again head of state.

00:04:21.317 --> 00:04:22.495
But guess what?

00:04:22.519 --> 00:04:25.134
This time I have been
democratically elected.

00:04:25.876 --> 00:04:30.369
(Applause)